  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 1.17.6 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* docs: fix argument order in the combined inject example by @agammann in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2044\n* docs: fix Git extras install example for current pip by @saitakarcesme in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2047\n* ci(pre-release): drop unused contents:write permission by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2050\n* 🐛 fix(manifest): make locked tools install on sync by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2052\n\n## New Contributors\n* @agammann made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2044\n* @saitakarcesme made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2047\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.17.5...1.17.6",
